# Drizzle regenerates a full ~324 KB snapshot per migration; collapse it in diffs so
# the reviewable migration.sql is not buried. Reviewers can still expand it.
#
# The glob is deliberately `drizzle/*/snapshot.json` rather than the conventional
# `drizzle/**/meta/*_snapshot.json`: drizzle v1 writes `drizzle/<timestamp>_<name>/`
# containing `migration.sql` and `snapshot.json`, with no `meta/` dir and no
# `_journal.json`. Keep `migration.sql` out of the glob — that is the part to read.
drizzle/*/snapshot.json linguist-generated=true
